║ Reason: ${reason.padEnd(51)} ║
║ Duration: ${duration}s                                              ║
║ Data Points: ${session.dataPoints.length.toString().padEnd(46)} ║
║ Techniques: ${new Set(session.techniques).size.toString().padEnd(47)} ║
║ Suspicion: ${session.suspicionLevel.toFixed(0).padEnd(48)} ║
╠════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
║           "They thought they won. They were wrong."        ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
    `);

    // Generate intelligence report
